    VERIFIED_WITH_SIGN_UP --> VERIFIED_WITH_SIGN_UP: finalize_sign_up_binding! / bind original verified signup candidate
UNVERIFIED --> SUSPENDED: retire_for_withdrawal!; preserve PII
    VERIFIED --> SUSPENDED: retire_for_withdrawal!; preserve PII
    SUSPENDED --> SUSPENDED: retire_for_withdrawal!; preserve PII
    DELETED --> SUSPENDED: retire_for_withdrawal!; preserve PII
